          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+abelian+group"} finite abelian group
          %h2#references References
          %p Textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Roman12
              %p
                Steven Roman,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fundamentals of group theory
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joseph+A.+Gallian"}> Joseph A. Gallian
                , Section 11 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Contemporary Abstract Algebra
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1201/9781003142331"} doi:10.1201/9781003142331
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://ict.iitk.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/CS203-Mathematics-for-Computer-Science-III-Gallian.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            A new proof of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+theorem+of+finite+abelian+groups"} fundamental theorem of finite abelian groups
            was given in
          %ul
            %li#Navarro03
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriel+Navarro"}> Gabriel Navarro
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the fundamental theorem of finite abelian groups
              %strong 110
              2 (2003) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1080/00029890.2003.11919951"}> doi:10.1080/00029890.2003.11919951
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p reviewed in
          %ul
            %li#Sullivan
              John Sullivan:
              %em Classification of finite abelian groups
              lecture notes (2003) &amp;lbrack;
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Sullivan-FiniteAbGroups.pdf", :title => "pdf"}> pdf
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also
